OL,3,ARyanair boss Michael O'Leary apologises
OL,4,Aover 'high-fare rapists' remarks
OL,5,
OL,6,FRyanair chief executive Michael O'Leary
OL,7,Fhas said he is "truly sorry" for
OL,8,Fdescribing rival airlines as "high-fare
OL,9,Frapists".
OL,11,FHe had previously refused to apologise
OL,12,Fto a rape crisis centre which
OL,13,Fcriticised him for the comments.
OL,15,FO'Leary had made the remark earlier
OL,16,Fthis month while talking to journalists
OL,17,Fahead of Ryanair's yearly meeting with
OL,18,Fshareholders.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
