OL,3,ARyanair boss Michael O'Leary apologises
OL,4,Aover 'high-fare rapists' remarks
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing the comments, the Dublin Rape
OL,7,FCrisis Centre (DRCC) wrote to him
OL,8,Fasking for an apology, in a letter seen
OL,9,Fby the BBC.
